<headline>Cronos Q1 shr loss $0.08 with charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CRONOS GROUP AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		    SUMMARY OF CONSOLIDATED INCOME STATEMENTS</p>
<p>(dollar amounts in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p>							    1996	1997</p>
<p> Total revenues				    $39,172    $40,483</p>
<p> Direct operating expenses			 7,824	9,827</p>
<p> Finance and restructuring expenses		  -	  919</p>
<p> Net income/(loss)				   1,816     ( 730)</p>
<p> Earnings/(loss) per common share		 0.21    ( 0.08)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		     8,837,015  8,858,378</p>
<p>Note: The company said the 1997 first quarter charge was mainly due to employee reorganization.</p>
